        self.frame_about_richtext.set_text("<b><size=15>Flydigi Vader 5 Pro Remapper</size></b>\n\n<size=11>A lightweight, portable remapping tool for the <b>Flydigi Vader 5 Pro</b>.</size>\n\n<size=11>It enables remapping of the controller's <color=#5C7FA8>vendor-specific buttons</color> (M1–M4, LM/RM, C/Z, Home, Share/Fn, Start and Select) to custom keyboard shortcuts and key combinations unavailable through standard XInput.</size>\n\n<size=11>Designed to <color=#5C7FA8>complement</color> Flydigi SpaceStation rather than replace it, the application focuses exclusively on advanced button remapping while remaining fully portable—no installation, registry entries, or AppData files required.</size>\n\n<b><size=13>GitHub</size></b>\n<size=11>github.com/DrProton824/vader5pro-hid-tools</size>\n\n<size=11>Developed by <b>DrProton824</b> \nOpen Source (MIT Licensed)</size>\n")
